            "SRC-006"
          ],
          "suggestions": []
        },
        {
          "statement": "The experimental design is comprehensive, covering multiple datasets of varying complexity (CIFAR-10/100, SVHN, ILSVRC) and model architectures (6-layer CNN, GoogLeNet), including ablations on training set size and augmentation scheduling.",
